    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every book in the image, it is positioned on the left side and has a complex arrangement of seven other objects associated with it. Directly below the book is a phone, and below the phone is a game controller; these three items form a vertically aligned column. To the right of the book is a glove, to the right of the phone is a mouse, and to the right of the game controller is a sock. These corresponding pairs are aligned horizontally. The glove, mouse, and sock also form a second vertical column, with the mouse below the glove and the sock below the mouse. Finally, a third partial column exists to the right: a fork is located to the right of the glove, and a lemon is to the right of the mouse. The fork is positioned above the lemon, and they are aligned vertically.",
